{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst","macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"description","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Calling this property directly is discouraged. Instead, convert an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance of any type to a string by using the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String(describing:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"initializer. This initializer works with any type, and uses the custom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":" property for types that conform to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomStringConvertible"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct Point: CustomStringConvertible {","    let x: Int, y: Int","","    var description: String {","        return \"(\\(x), \\(y))\"","    }","}","","let p = Point(x: 21, y: 30)","let s = String(describing: p)","print(s)","\/\/ Prints \"(21, 30)\""],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The conversion of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":" to a string in the assignment to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"s"},{"type":"text","text":" uses the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Point"},{"type":"text","text":" type’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/revenuecat\/logl